+
+### `app.isWebAuthnBrowserAuthenticatorAvailable()` _macOS_
+
+Returns `boolean` - Whether Chromium's browser passkey authenticator is supported
+by this process's macOS version and signed browser entitlement. This check does
+not request access to passkeys or enumerate credentials. `browserPasskeys` is
+opt-in and disabled by default. Its availability does not imply that a credential
+exists for a relying party or that the user will approve a request.
+
+When both `touchID` and `browserPasskeys` are enabled, the existing
+`select-webauthn-authenticator` event identifies the browser authenticator as
+`platformPasskeys` and defaults to it when no listener is installed.
 
